{
  "app_id": 2419670,
  "detailed_descriptions": {
    "en": "Eclipsium is a first-person horror game where you play as the desperate Wanderer. In search of Her, his path leads through hellish tombs, cathedrals of flesh and even through space, immolating himself and sacrificing anything to achieve his goal. Don’t stop There is no safety or comfort in Eclipsium. Let the pale light guide you through, as every place hides its own path to escape. Enter the spiral Everything fades and senses dull in this endless darkness. But with you remains your power - a twisting, transmuting hand, ready to carve a way through whatever stands before you. Find her Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it’s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.",
    "zh-Hant": "「蚀之境」是一款第一人稱恐怖遊戲。你將化身一名絕望的「流浪者」，在追尋「她」的途中，踏入地獄般的墓穴、血肉鑄就的殿堂，甚至穿越星空。燃盡自身，犧牲一切，只為抵達終點。 莫停步 蚀之境無庇護，亦無安慰。 任憑蒼白微光引路，每一處皆潛藏逃離之徑。 入螺旋 無盡黑暗中，萬物消逝， 五感逐漸鈍化。 唯有那扭曲蛻變之手仍與你同在，隨時準備劈開前路——無論前方阻擋何物。 去尋她 她她之微光，如今僅存記憶中的低語， 卻仍引領汝步履不止。 縱為誘餌，然於苦痛蚀夜之中， 亦是唯一之希望。",
    "zh-Hans": "《蚀之境》是一款第一人称恐怖游戏。你将化身一名绝望的“流浪者”，在追寻“她”的途中，踏入地狱般的墓穴、血肉筑就的殿堂，甚至穿越星空。燃尽自身，牺牲一切，只为抵达终点。 莫停步 蚀之境无庇护，亦无安慰。 任凭苍白微光引路，每一处皆潜藏其逃离之径。 入螺旋 无尽黑暗中，万物消逝， 五感逐渐钝化。 唯有那扭曲蜕变之手仍与你同在，随时准备劈开前路——无论前方挡立何物。 寻她去 她残光微弱，如今仅是记忆深处的一缕低语， 却仍牵引你步步向前。 即便为诱引之谋，于这苦难蚀夜中， 亦是你唯一的希望。",
    "ja": "『Eclipsium』は一人称視点ホラーゲーム。放浪者は追い詰められ、彼女を捜し求める。旅路は、地獄のような墓所、肉製の大聖堂、宇宙までをも貫く。自らを焼き尽くし、あらゆるものを犠牲にしてでも、目的を果たす。 止まるなかれ 『Eclipsium』には安全も安寧もない。淡い光を頼りに進む、あらゆる場所に異なる脱出路がある。 螺旋へ踏み込め 果てしない闇の中、あらゆるものは色褪せ、感覚は鈍くなる。だが、力は残されている。ねじれ、変身し続ける手。立ちはだかる全てを切り開く。 彼女を見つけよ 彼女の微かな光は、今や記憶の囁きに過ぎなくとも、前に引き寄せる力がある。たとえ、囮だとしても。苦悩に満たされた日食の内において、残された最後の希望として。",
    "ko": "이클립시움은 절박한 방랑자의 일인칭 시점에서 전개되는 공포 게임입니다. '그녀'를 찾아 헤매는 방랑자의 여정은, 지옥을 연상케 하는 무덤들이며, 살점으로 뒤덮인 대성당, 심지어는 우주로까지 이어집니다. 방랑자는 자신의 목적을 위해서라면 본인의 몸을 불사를 수 있을 뿐만 아니라 그 무엇조차 희생할 각오가 되어 있습니다. 멈추지 말지어다 이클립시움에서는 안식도, 안락함도 찾아볼 수 없습니다. 모든 장소는 각자의 탈출로를 꼭꼭 숨겨두고 있으니, 창백한 빛으로 하여금 당신의 길을 인도하게 하시기를. 나선 속으로 이 끝없는 어둠 속에서는 모든 것이 퇴색되고 감각은 무뎌만 집니다. 그러나 당신에게는 일말의 권능이 남아있는바, 이는 앞을 가로막는 그 무엇이건 깎아낼 기세의, 이리저리 뒤틀리며 변신하는 당신의 손입니다. 그녀를 찾아라 이제는 기억 속 속삭임만큼이나 가냘퍼진 그녀의 빛이 당신을 전진케 합니다. 비록 그 빛이 미끼일지라도, 고통스런 일식에 갇힌 당신에게 남아있는 유일한 희망은 이것뿐입니다."
  },
  "detailed_descriptions_html": {
    "en": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Eclipsium is a first-person horror game where you play as the desperate Wanderer. In search of Her, his path leads through hellish tombs, cathedrals of flesh and even through space, immolating himself and sacrificing anything to achieve his goal.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Don’t stop</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no safety or comfort in Eclipsium. Let the pale light guide you through, as every place hides its own path to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter the spiral</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything fades and senses dull in this endless darkness. But with you remains your power - a twisting, transmuting hand, ready to carve a way through whatever stands before you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find her</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her weak light, now little more than a whisper of a memory, pulls you forward. Even if it’s a lure, it remains your only hope inside the anguished eclipse.</p>",
    "zh-Hant": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>「蚀之境」是一款第一人稱恐怖遊戲。你將化身一名絕望的「流浪者」，在追尋「她」的途中，踏入地獄般的墓穴、血肉鑄就的殿堂，甚至穿越星空。燃盡自身，犧牲一切，只為抵達終點。</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >莫停步</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >蚀之境無庇護，亦無安慰。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >任憑蒼白微光引路，每一處皆潛藏逃離之徑。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >入螺旋</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >無盡黑暗中，萬物消逝，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五感逐漸鈍化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >唯有那扭曲蛻變之手仍與你同在，隨時準備劈開前路——無論前方阻擋何物。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >去尋她</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她她之微光，如今僅存記憶中的低語，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >卻仍引領汝步履不止。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >縱為誘餌，然於苦痛蚀夜之中，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >亦是唯一之希望。</p>",
    "zh-Hans": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>《蚀之境》是一款第一人称恐怖游戏。你将化身一名绝望的“流浪者”，在追寻“她”的途中，踏入地狱般的墓穴、血肉筑就的殿堂，甚至穿越星空。燃尽自身，牺牲一切，只为抵达终点。</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >莫停步</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >蚀之境无庇护，亦无安慰。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >任凭苍白微光引路，每一处皆潜藏其逃离之径。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >入螺旋</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无尽黑暗中，万物消逝，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >五感逐渐钝化。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >唯有那扭曲蜕变之手仍与你同在，随时准备劈开前路——无论前方挡立何物。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >寻她去</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >她残光微弱，如今仅是记忆深处的一缕低语，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >却仍牵引你步步向前。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >即便为诱引之谋，于这苦难蚀夜中，</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >亦是你唯一的希望。</p>",
    "ja": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>『Eclipsium』は一人称視点ホラーゲーム。放浪者は追い詰められ、彼女を捜し求める。旅路は、地獄のような墓所、肉製の大聖堂、宇宙までをも貫く。自らを焼き尽くし、あらゆるものを犠牲にしてでも、目的を果たす。</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >止まるなかれ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『Eclipsium』には安全も安寧もない。淡い光を頼りに進む、あらゆる場所に異なる脱出路がある。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >螺旋へ踏み込め</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >果てしない闇の中、あらゆるものは色褪せ、感覚は鈍くなる。だが、力は残されている。ねじれ、変身し続ける手。立ちはだかる全てを切り開く。</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >彼女を見つけよ</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >彼女の微かな光は、今や記憶の囁きに過ぎなくとも、前に引き寄せる力がある。たとえ、囮だとしても。苦悩に満たされた日食の内において、残された最後の希望として。</p>",
    "ko": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>이클립시움은 절박한 방랑자의 일인칭 시점에서 전개되는 공포 게임입니다. '그녀'를 찾아 헤매는 방랑자의 여정은, 지옥을 연상케 하는 무덤들이며, 살점으로 뒤덮인 대성당, 심지어는 우주로까지 이어집니다. 방랑자는 자신의 목적을 위해서라면 본인의 몸을 불사를 수 있을 뿐만 아니라 그 무엇조차 희생할 각오가 되어 있습니다.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >멈추지 말지어다</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/aebeed5b1f059c93bf68c138062c4b04.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >이클립시움에서는 안식도, 안락함도 찾아볼 수 없습니다. 모든 장소는 각자의 탈출로를 꼭꼭 숨겨두고 있으니, 창백한 빛으로 하여금 당신의 길을 인도하게 하시기를.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >나선 속으로</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/77e5011ef88cca600d2866b5ce384bb1.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >이 끝없는 어둠 속에서는 모든 것이 퇴색되고 감각은 무뎌만 집니다. 그러나 당신에게는 일말의 권능이 남아있는바, 이는 앞을 가로막는 그 무엇이건 깎아낼 기세의, 이리저리 뒤틀리며 변신하는 당신의 손입니다.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >그녀를 찾아라</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.poster.avif?t=1777045076\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.webm?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2419670/extras/837ab06703c69581ac882df601a45914.mp4?t=1777045076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >이제는 기억 속 속삭임만큼이나 가냘퍼진 그녀의 빛이 당신을 전진케 합니다. 비록 그 빛이 미끼일지라도, 고통스런 일식에 갇힌 당신에게 남아있는 유일한 희망은 이것뿐입니다.</p>"
  }
}
